            <span class="step-description">Step 4: Create the target table in the 'staging' schema with appropriate data types (BIGINT due to Power BI).</span>
            <div class="code-container sql-block"><pre><code><span class="sql-com">-- 4. Create the target table with appropriate data types</span>
<span class="sql-com">-- due to a bug in Power BI, BIGINT had to be used</span>
<span class="sql-key">CREATE TABLE</span> staging.SpotifySongs (
